==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 0.67~4 seconds<sup>20f~120f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] (200%) spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*3 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 0.07~0.33 seconds<sup>2f~10f</sup>.
*10 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] (200%) spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*10 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*5 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] (200%) spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 0.07~13.33 seconds<sup>2f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Duche]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[B.B.Bunny]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] (200%) spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 1.33~6 seconds<sup>40f~180f</sup>.
**20 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 0.07~0.33 seconds<sup>2f~10f</sup>.
**20 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] (200%) spawn, delay 0.07~0.33 seconds<sup>2f~10f</sup>.
**2 [[Samurai Doggy|Samurai Doggies]] spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use units like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] and some meatshields to defend against the waves of other enemies, then use [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]] and/or [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Fish Cat]] to destroy Samurai Doggy.

